 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's exports to the United States increased from 323.6 million euros in 2005 to 421.0 million euros in 2025, a rise of 30.1%.",
  "The largest export value was in 2023, reaching 508.3 million euros.",
  "Imports from the United States grew from 572.4 million euros in 2005 to 638.1 million euros in 2025, with a peak of 1.76 billion euros in 2012.",
  "The two largest import periods, 2012 and 2015, accounted for 18.7% of total imports over 2005–2025.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for inflation or price changes."
 ],
